# Practice (the Club difficulty) through its setup; undo, hint, the board
# state panel and the camera reset in a running match; Restart from pause;
# Leave Match back to the title.
until 300 Daily Challenge
frames 10
click =Practice
until 60 Difficulty
frames 10
click Start
frames 260
hold ArrowLeft
frames 20
release ArrowLeft
key KeyH 2
key KeyB 2
frames 40
expect Puck at column
save practice-board
key KeyZ 2
key KeyC 2
frames 30
key Escape 2
until 60 =Paused
frames 10
click =Restart
frames 60
key Escape 2
until 60 =Paused
frames 10
click Leave Match
until 60 Daily Challenge
